  <item>
    <title>淡水河畔的谎言：台湾八里双尸案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670016826c7f817786d2df73</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670016826c7f817786d2df73</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Oct 2024 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，国庆节快乐呀！欢迎来到「丛中谜行」😘</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期Liv为大家带来一个台湾省的案子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>富豪夫妇离奇失踪，遗体惊现淡水河畔，背后隐藏着怎样的惊天秘密？ 当代龙门客栈，咖啡店长变身冷血杀手，五个版本的供词又隐藏了多少谎言？ 是为情，是复仇，还是为钱？ 让我们开始今天的故事!</span></p><span></span><p><span>跳过前面碎碎念 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>吕炳宏采访台湾话翻译：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我跟你讲吕炳宏！你如果不说实话，你会很惨的！你最好给我说实话！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspwQaqI50ifd4LaDP9tvV0btkjl.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>张翠萍、陈进福夫妇</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpCsSBWVpgk3IQvADYPJvjw49DEN.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>咖啡店活动照</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>谢依涵（左）吕炳宏（中）陈进福（右）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsi8-kYb0wcDJs4u82l9rVim6LMi.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>吕炳宏接受采访时照片</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr1YXWCLlsGpaSmwq1Ramn1_1gA4.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>谢依涵和男友祝宜峯</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpoChzoEwrkbN7QYHSqZjJaZ_ITb.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>谢依涵和男友祝宜峯</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiEewFL3Valg-Q_9TYxPXRf2ozUt.webp"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>谢依涵被逮捕后</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjDWPlCzR7Op_bO2Gu_xU5BIR5Qh.webp"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>如今的妈妈嘴咖啡店</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：On my way - &nbsp;萨吉</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu2a88QdxbEwJGdV-0azWLG1y4_w.m4a" length="72173357" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJno8ViCkhSN8wKMmmzzpzbh6Bi.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep04秘鲁空难：1/92的幸运，雨林生存11天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ce56bdf78678cbe7906f11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ce56bdf78678cbe7906f11</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Aug 2024 22:44:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1971年的平安夜，她从3000米的高空坠落，落入秘鲁亚马逊雨林的深处——成为了九十二分之一的奇迹。年仅17岁的她孤身一人，在充满致命危险的环境中顽强求生。饥饿、伤痛、孤独……她经历了常人难以想象的考验，却凭借超凡的毅力和对生命的渴望，奇迹般地走出了这片无人问津的原始丛林。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你问我世界上最幸运的女孩是谁，我会告诉你，她的名字叫Juliane Koepcke。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj1G2HCcYPhpjchhnXMeughvZZlz.webp"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>朱利安一家三口</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6XFJS-FQuzf_9140RvRE6fQSuA.webp"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>年幼的朱利安和妈妈</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrCiiYCropnGB646SPZESIObXsgG.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>朱利安在获救时拍的照片</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv9DFYkdtqXXRW1-H57mZl6XBaPs.webp"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>朱利安在父亲的陪伴下做康复</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNhkWhRTE81o5G3At_cSEOz-Y81.webp"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>获救后，朱利安成为了世界的头版头条</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxsD3qX7pleZ6ncMUlBB7OQWdIt.webp"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>朱利安在 纪录片《希望之翼》中，坐在与她从高空坠入丛林后醒来时坐在的位置</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lseBT8KJJi6IobKLnm0QjYFcKUd3.m4a" length="46615342" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgLqP9zRbrMmE6AlZAexcBbgXZSb.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>新西兰双女弑母案：天上的生物</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a03da17349f7a557100bab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a03da17349f7a557100bab</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jul 2024 23:32:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在1950年代的基督城，两名少女结下了非同寻常的友谊。她们不仅共同分享秘密，还创造了一个属于她们自己的幻想世界和宗教。然而，这段友谊却逐渐发展成了一段扭曲的关系，二人也慢慢步入歧途...&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>这个案件不仅震惊了当地社会，还被改编成了一部著名的电影《Heavenly Creatures》,由彼得·杰克逊（指环王导演）执导。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvablwLwBpvznCELMexSxcJ0VUew.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><span>童年时期Juliet Hulme</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo8OuUrzUlKtJbVEHQAvgsFNUSld.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><span>Juliet父亲-英国科学家 Henry Rainsford Hulme</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm0zZMVnMHS8wrczK9qKqQO962BG.jpeg"></figure><blockquote><p><span>Pauline Parker 宝琳 （中间低头）</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpC22l6pVBde3-p10jxPhUKLV03v.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><span>高中时期的宝琳（左）与朱丽叶（右）</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMb7hIn5IJxpl9f6D_WIEFbum-r.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><span>1954年，二人离开听证会</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlkSOEhReK8Qi0grtqZ_30DEIozk.webp"></figure><blockquote><p><span>晚年的朱丽叶（已改名为Anne Perry）</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujaHpNZ118P0KhLPifBmmUridJq.webp"></figure><blockquote><p><span>晚年的宝琳 （已改名为Hilary Nathan）</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsmmtVw5fzNrjaXiMYugaEyrAFSA.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><span>影视作品中的二人（来源：Heavenly Creatures）</span></p></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv3F6YsTsvyOTjz5mkbJ2frQvbdZ.m4a" length="53417505" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv0BQFADQnpfS1BpzSv-NZuc7Miw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep02母亲的直觉：来自鬼魂的证词</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668e038aae8e21859ac678fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668e038aae8e21859ac678fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2024 03:44:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是美国唯一一起基于鬼魂的证词而判处谋杀罪的案件。</span></p><span></span><p><span>23岁的Elva Zona Heaster（艾瓦·佐娜·希斯特）在结婚三个月后不幸离世，人们都以为她是自然死亡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是有一个人不相信这个所谓的“事实”，就是女孩的母亲Mary Jane Heaster（玛丽·简·希斯特）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>母亲的直觉告诉自己，女儿的死一定有问题，直到那个夜晚，女儿鬼魂的来访，终于让一切真相大白。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpL1t3qif_cZE0DzKGbzIhVqOkyn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Zona和Erasmus Stribbling Trout Shue（爱德华）-1896</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpDLgA1Vs043U1MLEUErgaR_AdW3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Mary Jane Heaster（玛丽·简·希斯特）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foje7nNPw2T8U6hw0PHkrOUzu0tR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Mary Jane Heaster（玛丽·简·希斯特）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr3fWrRYuAcW_NRVhFWt7NRATTJZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Zona和爱德华的故居</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpCT83jWz-heeX7ykczrsbTeT-gh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>记载着这个故事的西弗吉尼亚州的州历史纪念牌</span></p><span></span><p><span>延伸阅读——</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dietz, Dennis. </span><em><span>The Greenbrier Ghost and Other Strange Stories</span></em><span>, South Charleston, WV, Mountain Memories Books, 1990.</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://allthatsinteresting.com/greenbrier-ghost" data-url="https://allthatsinteresting.com/greenbrier-ghost"><span>allthatsinteresting.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/30608/elva-zona-heaster-ghost-who-helped-solve-her-own-murder" data-url="https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/30608/elva-zona-heaster-ghost-who-helped-solve-her-own-murder"><span>www.mentalfloss.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loWwXwK-HJcIJWBG66Zwvewe6u_V.m4a" length="44831214" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJno8ViCkhSN8wKMmmzzpzbh6Bi.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>了不起的詹妮弗：追凶十九年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66820baacdd230b23b538a61</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66820baacdd230b23b538a61</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 05:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 大家好呀, 我是Liv丽芙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家来到《丛中谜行》</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里我会和大家讲述一些真实罪案，和一些精彩的悬疑/灵异的真实故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家多多提建议提想法，帮助节目快速成长！</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然喜欢丽芙的话也不要吝啬赞美啦，嘿嘿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jennifer Schuett，一个惧怕黑暗的八岁小女孩，在挑战黑暗的一天却迎来了自己的人生至暗时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对黑暗她即使遍体鳞伤，也勇敢帮助警察提供线索，终于在十九年后迎来真相。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她不是受害者，她是胜利者。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8Rv3c_9sRbLMpt8hz6asfPjrhb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本案主人公: Jennifer Schuett</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1B9OhjwqXVMv5BDpt1HhVXeqSP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>恢复中的Jennifer Schuett</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpFvXYxx1tO0SWGuQQl5hQFImgwQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>我睡着了。一个男人打开窗户抓住了我。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnHVRLrxA5QFQJCEMsYJ_fVgJ_w.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>他是白人，戴眼镜，有一把尖刀，身上有一两处绿色纹身。他留着黑色小胡子，30 多岁。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FryLvK6l3RKYtKLvB7gDkBfdDtnm.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>他说：“我在车库工作，还有迪金森警局和加尔维斯顿警局”蓝裤子、黑衬衫、万宝路香烟</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnIiN_u-xxXAdENXqGau1G75UD9c.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>他说他的名字叫Dinnese（丹尼斯）</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8VGwMD4C3A0gO5L-32zxKJ85A4.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>Jennifer绘制的停车场地图</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FttyqXeOKaPfIwbD-5T0spyO2j8m.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Dennis Bradford驾驶证照片（左）Jennifer提供的嫌疑人画像（右）对比</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhi5VWVKwFvpJGNApcydLYsHKMup.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>被捕时的Dennis Bradford</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FshHNI3mL0xX4aEMQ317cToTWuuE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Jennifer接受CBS采访</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://frankweberauthor.com/blog/a-nightmare-in-dickinson-the-amazing-jennifer-schuett" href="https://frankweberauthor.com/blog/a-nightmare-in-dickinson-the-amazing-jennifer-schuett">frankweberauthor.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.cbsnews.com/news/jennifer-schuett-case-afraid-of-the-dark-texas-woman-seeks-justice-in-childhood-kidnapping-attack/" href="https://www.cbsnews.com/news/jennifer-schuett-case-afraid-of-the-dark-texas-woman-seeks-justice-in-childhood-kidnapping-attack/">www.cbsnews.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://archives.fbi.gov/archives/news/stories/2009/october/shuett_101309" href="https://archives.fbi.gov/archives/news/stories/2009/october/shuett_101309">archives.fbi.gov</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3h-lNl9otws" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3h-lNl9otws">www.youtube.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll7BjQun6yfRYOyGZSM-_tKvU7k3.m4a" length="36392156" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJno8ViCkhSN8wKMmmzzpzbh6Bi.jpg"/>
